    "core_memories": [
      "Captured Moonrise Ship and True Soul Leader at Wyrm's Tooth.",
      "Used God-Mode CHA/Idol to psychically hijack the True Soul Leader, overriding the Absolute's control.",
      "Interrogated True Soul Leader: Revealed 'The Ascension' plot for Tarsakh 7 (Parliament Infection) and identified Captain Valerian as a traitor.",
      "[auto] The ship groans as it cuts through the black water of the Chionthar, the storm outside battering the hull. Inside the Captain's Quarters, the only light comes from the viole",
      "Isolated Captain Valerian at the Umbrage Estate. Activated Idol's Malice, achieving psychic dominance to interrogate him about Orin before deciding his fate. Rejected simple assassination in favor of intelligence gathering.",
      "Psychically probed Captain Valerian: Confirmed Orin is the true threat, not the Absolute. Orin plans to assassinate Duke Ravengard at the Gala. Valerian's mind shattered in the process.",
      "Executed Captain Valerian in the Umbrage Estate Solarium to fulfill the contract with Keene. Confirmed Orin the Bhaalist is the true threat, targeting Duke Ravengard at the Gala.",
      "Executed Captain Valerian. Confirmed Orin as the Bhaalist threat targeting Ravengard. Convened War Council with Vesper and Silas to decide the Duke's fate.",
      "Used Soul Coin Divination: Confirmed Gortash has Emergency Edict 14 ready. If Ravengard dies, Steel Watch declares Martial Law immediately.",
      "Used True Sight at the Gala to identify Orin disguised as Ravengard's bodyguard.",
      "Intercepted Orin at the Gala. Surgically amputated her limbs to neutralize the Slayer form. Captured the Chosen of Bhaal alive.",
      "Intercepted Orin at the Gala. Surgically amputated her limbs to neutralize the Slayer form. Captured the Chosen of Bhaal alive. Forced Duke Ravengard to publicly endorse the Sovereign Shield.",
      "Used God-Mode Detect Thoughts to rip the location of the Temple of Bhaal from Orin's mind. Discovered Orin's Netherstone is unguarded on the Altar. Gortash plans to seize it.",
      "Defeated and captured Orin the Red (Chosen of Bhaal). Seized her legendary weapons. Reached Level 9 (Tier 2/3 transition).",
      "Interrogated Orin: Revealed 'Farslayer Gislev' guards the Temple Bridge with 'Unstoppable' mechanic and 'Power Word Kill' ritual.",
      "Used God-Mode Infernal Siphon to Dominate Farslayer Gislev, turning the Temple's defenses against Gortash's approaching Steel Watch.",
      "Ambushed Gortash at the Temple of Bhaal. Turned Farslayer Gislev against the Steel Watch. Landed a devastating alpha strike on the Archduke.",
      "Ambushed and captured Enver Gortash alive on the Temple Bridge. Turned the Farslayer against the Steel Watch. Seized the Netherstone of Bane.",
      "Defeated Gortash and the Steel Watch on the Temple Bridge. Seized the Netherstone of Bane and the Netherstone of Bhaal. Captured Farslayer Gislev.",
      "Broke Gortash using the 'Obsolete' bluff and the threat of Orin. Secured Steel Watch override codes: 'Tyrant-Ascendant-Zero'.",
      "Interrogated Gortash using the 'Obsolete' bluff. Secured Steel Watch override: 'Tyrant-Ascendant-Zero'. Confirmed Elder Brain location: Morphic Pool via Submersible (Code: 'Dominion').",
      "Interrogated Gortash: Confirmed Steel Watch Foundry requires physical breach due to 'Iron Curtain' protocol and 'Titan' guardian.",
      "Seized control of the Steel Watch Foundry. Crippled Enver Gortash (severed tendons) to neutralize him as a threat while keeping him as a political asset.",
      "Mastered the Steel Watch control protocols directly from Gortash. Became the sole Admin of the mechanical army.",
      "Reached Level 10 (Bard). Unlocked Magical Secrets. Separated Gortash and Orin to prevent conspiracy.",
      "Executed the Trinity Ritual using the True Soul Leader as a living conduit. Dominated the Elder Brain without destroying it. Became the Absolute.",
      "Executed 'Infernal Siphon: The Lobotomy' on the Elder Brain. Consumed its intellect to gain 'Absolute Knowledge'. Reduced the Brain to a biological server for the Steel Watch and Hive Mind.",
      "Reached Level 12. Defeated and Lobotomized the Elder Brain (24,000 XP). Separated Gortash (Shadow Bank) and Orin (Coiled Serpent) to prevent resonance.",
      "Achieved Level 13 (Tier 3/4 Transition). Unlocked 7th Level Magic and Metamagic Adept. Defeated Netherbrain (Mythic).",
      "Achieved Level 13. Learned Teleport. Defeated the Netherbrain and established the Shadow Empire.",
      "Teleported to High Hall. Accepted the Coronet from Ravengard. Established the 'God-King in Shadow' reign. Campaign Victory.",
      "Delegated the 'Three Threats' to lieutenants. Vesper secured the Shield of the Hidden Lord. Silas crushed the Githyanki. Lyra bought Mol. Total victory via proxy.",
      "Synthesized the 'Rite of the Eclipse' using the Elder Brain. The path to Godhood requires consuming Gargauth, wearing the Crown of Karsus, and a mass-enchantment Wedding.",
      "Consumed Zariel, Archduchess of Avernus. Acquired Portfolio of War and Divine Rank 2.",
      "Defeated and Subjugated Tiamat in Avernus. Annexed the First Layer of Hell. Achieved status of God-King of Two Realms.",
      "Defeated and Subjugated Tiamat in Avernus via Infernal Contract. Annexed the First Layer of Hell."
    ],
